<title>USA: GTECH names William O'Connor CEO.</title>
<headline>GTECH names William O'Connor CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WEST GREENWICH, R.I. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTECH Holdings Corp said Tuesday it elected William O'Connor chief executive officer effective July 14.</p>
<p>The company said O'Connor replaces Guy Snowden. Snowden will continue as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>O'Connor has worked at GTECH since 1994 as president and chief operating officer under an employment agreement which contemplated him becoming CEO.</p>
<p>GTECH is a supplier of computerized on-line lottery products and services.</p>
